<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Go-Ahead buy of ex-British rail firm.</title>
<headline>EU clears Go-Ahead buy of ex-British rail firm.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared the acquisition by Go-Ahead Group Plc of Britain and Via Generale de Transport et d'Industrie of France of the former British rail firm which operates the Thameslink line.</p>
</text>
